  "content_description": "Action Item - Teams",
  "content_text_body": "People feel valued and included when their team members listen to and act on their ideas. The goal is to be fully present when listening so that you can evaluate, champion, and implement your team's good ideas.\n\n### Listen to ideas\n\nShow your team members respect by acknowledging their unique experiences and honoring their individual points of view. Doing this with sincerity demonstrates that you genuinely care about them as people.\n\n### Act on good ideas\n\nWhen team members share ideas, listen openly and carefully.  As you respond, encourage them to think critically about those ideas to evaluate their potential. Help each other brainstorm ways to implement these ideas, encouraging team members to take the lead, as appropriate.",
